<title>BELGIUM: CCB CUTS SAVINGS CERTIFICATES RATES FROM WEDNESDAY.</title>
<headline>CCB CUTS SAVINGS CERTIFICATES RATES FROM WEDNESDAY.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgian Credit</p>
<p>Communal/Gemeentekrediet said on Monday it would cut interest</p>
<p>rates on the following bank savings certificates from Wednesday:</p>
<p>    MATURITY	  NEW RATE	OLD RATE</p>
<p>    two years	 3.10 pct	3.15</p>
<p>    three years     3.50 pct	3.65</p>
<p>    four years	3.90 pct	4.10</p>
<p>    five years	4.30 pct	4.50</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
</text>
